D2F8 C43F             (    forth6809.asm):02217                     ANDB  #OUTBUFSZ-1
D2FA F1017A           (    forth6809.asm):02218                     CMPB  OUTTAIL
D2FD 273A             (    forth6809.asm):02219                     BEQ   PUT_EXIT          ; Yes! Exit discarding character.
