                      (    forth6809.asm):03485         
D8F2                  (    forth6809.asm):03486         TNDOUBLE:                           ; U currently holds [UDLO(bottom), UDHI(top)], matching
                      (    forth6809.asm):03487                                             ; ANS's (ud1) stack order directly.
D8F2 DC00             (    forth6809.asm):03488                     LDD   STATE
D8F4 27B1             (    forth6809.asm):03489                     BEQ   ILOOP             ; interpreting: already correctly placed,
                      (    forth6809.asm):03490                                             ; nothing more to do
