                      (    forth6809.asm):03492                     ; must execute at runtime - low first (lands deep), high
                      (    forth6809.asm):03493                     ; second (lands on top). UDHI is currently on top of U, so
                      (    forth6809.asm):03494                     ; pop it aside first, freeing UDLO to be compiled first.
