E3F7 ED42             (    forth6809.asm):05717                     STD   2,U
E3F9 3342             (    forth6809.asm):05718                     LEAU  2,U
E3FB 39               (    forth6809.asm):05719                     RTS
                      (    forth6809.asm):05720         
                      (    forth6809.asm):05721         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
                      (    forth6809.asm):05722         ; TUCK  ( x1 x2 -- x2 x1 x2 )
