                      (    forth6809.asm):08904         ; ENVIRONMENT?  ( c-addr u -- false | i*x true )
                      (    forth6809.asm):08905         ; Look up the attribute name c-addr u first in ENVTABLE (single-cell
                      (    forth6809.asm):08906         ; values), then in ENVTABLE2 (double-cell values). If found, return
                      (    forth6809.asm):08907         ; the value and true; otherwise return false. WORDLISTS is 8, the
